            "date": "2026-11-21T12:47:44+01:00"
          },
          "message": "fix: API pagination in `/repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls/{index}/reviews` (#15354)\n\nFixes a bug in pagination in the API `/repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls/{index}/reviews`: if a review is found in the database in state pending, it would be omitted from the return value after the pagination is applied, resulting in pagination returning an unexpected number of records.\n\nThis issue was identified by code analysis on possible API issues that will arise from enforcing pagination in the API (#13960).\n\n### Compliance\n\n- [x] I confirm that I make this contribution in accordance with [Forgejo's AI Agreement](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/governance/src/commit/9084720dc6a7fbf1d3f358919d46bd6adfb55287/AIAgreement.md).\n\n### Tests for Go changes\n\n- I added test coverage for Go changes...\n  - [ ] in their respective `*_test.go` for unit tests.\n  - [x] in the `tests/integration` directory if it involves interactions with a live Forgejo server.\n- I ran...\n  - [x] `make pr-go` before pushing\n\n### Documentation\n\n- [ ] I created a pull request [to the documentation](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/docs) to explain to Forgejo users how to use this change.\n- [x] I did not document these changes and I do not expect someone else to do it.\n\n### Release notes\n\n- [x] This change will be noticed by a Forgejo user or admin (feature, bug fix, performance, etc.). I suggest to include a release note for this change.\n- [ ] This change is not visible to a Forgejo user or admin (refactor, dependency upgrade, etc.). I think there is no need to add a release note for this change.\n\n<!--start release-notes-assistant-->\n\n## Release notes\n<!--URL:https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo-->\n- Bug fixes\n  - [PR](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/15354): <!--number 15354 --><!--line 0 --><!--description QVBJIHBhZ2luYXRpb24gaW4gYC9yZXBvcy97b3duZXJ9L3tyZXBvfS9wdWxscy97aW5kZXh9L3Jldmlld3Ng-->API pagination in `/repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls/{index}/reviews`<!--description-->\n<!--end release-notes-assistant-->\n\nReviewed-on: https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/15354\nReviewed-by: Andreas Ahlenstorf <redacted@example.invalid>\n",
